From caf-talk Caf Jun  9 08:05:48 1995
Newsgroups: comp.org.eff.talk,comp.org.cpsr.talk,gnu.misc.discuss,alt.comp.acad-freedom.talk,aus.org.efa,aus.general,aus.politics,aus.legal
