are brief announcements of interest to all, the reason being that the
mail spool fills up VERY quickly, if long messages are sent to
everyone in the department. When it fills up, incoming email gets
lost. General discussions relevant to the everyone should be conducted
on the local newsgroup cs.misc. By the way, on the matter of your WWW
